      "is_best": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>There’s a block diagram in the <strong>Datasheet</strong> - it shows that the Flash on the <strong>AHB </strong>bus:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/859bd244-1801-4c5d-9376-acd185e88571.png\"/></figure><p><a href=\"https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/stm32u575ri.pdf#page=21\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/stm32u575ri.pdf#page=21</a></p><p> </p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/51d7b774-ebeb-45cf-9987-9d487be3c413.png\"/></figure><p> </p><p> </p><p><strong><u>PS</u>:</strong></p><p>AHB is part of ARM’s Advanced Microcontroller Bus Architecture (AMBA):</p><p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advanced_Microcontroller_Bus_Architecture#Advanced_High-performance_Bus_(AHB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advanced_Microcontroller_Bus_Architecture#Advanced_High-performance_Bus_(AHB)</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.arm.com/architecture/system-architectures/amba\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.arm.com/architecture/system-architectures/amba</a></p></div>"
